<title>UK: UK grain traders bid for wheat, barley at tender.</title>
<headline>UK grain traders bid for wheat, barley at tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK grain traders bid for licences to export free market wheat and barley at the weekly European Union (EU) tender on Thursday, the UK Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce said.</p>
<p>The board said it could give no further details as there were less than three bids.</p>
<p>All bids will be considered at Thursday's weekly EU cereals management committee meeting.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
